  "questionId": "q21",
  "speechText": "For me, I want to keep growing in backend development, but I also want to work more with data and AI. The main reason is that this position combines backend work with AI, so it matches what I want to do next. For example, recently I’ve had some chances to work on AI-related features in real products, and I found that I really enjoy this direction. I also like Everfit because it is a global product in the health and fitness area, and it has real users and real impact. Because of that, I feel this is a good place for me to learn more, take on a new challenge, and step out of my comfort zone. At the same time, I believe my backend experience can help me contribute from the beginning. So overall, I think this position is a good match for both my experience and my career direction.",
